@startuml SynchronizeLibrary
title Synchronize Library - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "UI Layer" as UI
participant "SyncService" as Sync
participant "ConflictResolver" as CR
participant "CloudStorage" as Cloud
participant "LocalStorage" as Local
participant "IndexService" as Index

User -> UI : Trigger sync
UI -> Sync : synchronize()
Sync -> Local : getLocalChanges()
Local --> Sync : localChanges
Sync -> Cloud : getRemoteChanges()
Cloud --> Sync : remoteChanges
Sync -> CR : resolve(localChanges, remoteChanges)
CR --> Sync : mergedChanges
Sync -> Local : applyChanges(mergedChanges)
Sync -> Cloud : pushChanges(mergedChanges)
Sync -> Index : rebuildIndex()
Sync --> UI : syncComplete
UI --> User : Library up to date

@enduml
